WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.170 line:73%
6 kWp na solar, 6 kW na
inverter. Pareho ba 'yan?

c02
00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.290 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:15.530 line:73%
Hindi. Ang kWp ay DC rating
ng panels sa test conditions.

c04
00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:21.260 line:73%
Ang kW ng inverter ay AC
output na kaya nitong ilabas.

c05
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.150 line:73%
Puwedeng mas malaki ang
panels kaysa inverter.

c06
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.750 line:73%
Tinatawag itong
DC-to-AC ratio.

c07
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:30.400 line:73%
Kapag sobra ang DC sa
tanghali, may clipping.

c08
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.350 line:73%
Normal 'yan, basta tama
ang design at kalkula.

cz1
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:40.230 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.990 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
